{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05453","headline":"奉和圣制送张说巡边 · 王光庭","name":"奉和圣制送张说巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贤相德符充，朝推文武雄。\n海波先若镜，关草豫从风。\n钺助将军勇，威成天子功。\n琼章九霄发，锡宴五衢通。\n玉辗龙盘带，金装凤勒骢。\n虎貔纷儗儗，河洛振熊熊。\n戈剑千霜白，旌旗万火红。\n示刑夷夏变，流惠鬼方同。\n寇息军容偃，尘销朔野空。\n用师敷礼乐，非是爲獯戎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}